 NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information (2022): ETOPO 2022
 15 Arc-Second Global Relief Model. DOI: 10.25921/fd45-gt74.
 The bundled source is the 60 arc-second ice-surface elevation GeoTIFF.
 The AOWIS visual overview is derived from it by Web Mercator reprojection,
 averaging, quantization and clamping negative heights to zero.
 The original GeoTIFF is retained unmodified.
